&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;div class="profile-preview-card relative mb-4 s:mb-0 fw-medium hidden m:inline-block"&gt;

Mohit Sapat



&lt;div id="story-author-preview-content-4819452" class="profile-preview-card__content crayons-dropdown branded-7 p-4 pt-0"&gt;
&lt;div class="gap-4 grid"&gt;
&lt;div class="-mt-4"&gt;
