&lt;a href="https://dev.to/babelize/next-intl-vs-react-i18next-which-react-i18n-library-should-you-use-36mj#comments" class="crayons-btn crayons-btn--s crayons-btn--ghost crayons-btn--icon-left flex items-center"&gt;


